{\b Strata Historian ODBC Driver}\par\par
This driver reads PI data through PI Web API. It is read-only: it never writes to PI.\par\par
{\b Not an AVEVA product.} PI, PI System and PI Web API are trademarks of AVEVA. This driver is independent and is not supported by AVEVA.\par\par
{\b Licensing of PI access is your responsibility.} AVEVA's terms may require a PI System Access (PSA) licence for a non-AVEVA program that reads PI data. Confirm this with whoever manages your AVEVA agreement before using the driver on production data. See docs\\team-rollout.md.\par\par
{\b Test builds.} Builds that are not signed by your organization are for testing only, not for gateways or production hosts.\par\par
